---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Features" description="Full feature overview of podcast-transcriber.">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-100 mb-4">Features</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 mb-12 max-w-2xl">
      Everything podcast-transcriber can do today, sourced from the project feature overview.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

      <!-- 1. RSS Feed Sync -->
      <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6">
        <h2 class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">1. RSS Feed Sync</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3">
          Interactive CLI for downloading and transcribing podcast episodes from <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">feeds.txt</code>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-2 font-medium">Episode selection modes:</p>
        <ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1 list-disc list-inside mb-3">
          <li>All episodes</li>
          <li>All not yet transcribed</li>
          <li>Last N episodes</li>
          <li>Individual pick by number or range (<code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">1,3,5-8</code>)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-1 font-medium">Per-feed config options:</p>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm"><code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">model=</code>, <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">language=</code>, <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">pipeline=</code></p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Single-Pass Transcription -->
      <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6">
        <h2 class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">2. Single-Pass Transcription</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3">
          Default mode. One model, one pass. Configure per feed with <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">model=X</code>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-2 font-medium">Output per episode:</p>
        <ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
          <li><code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">.txt</code> — plain text transcript</li>
          <li><code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">.srt</code> — SubRip subtitles</li>
          <li><code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">.json</code> — segments with timestamps</li>
          <li><code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">.nfo</code> — hardware info, model, word count, realtime ratio</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Multi-Pass Pipeline -->
      <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6">
        <h2 class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">3. Multi-Pass Pipeline (<code class="text-sm">pipeline=full</code>)</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3">
          Staged transcription for higher quality on difficult audio.
        </p>
        <ol class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1.5 list-decimal list-inside">
          <li>Convert to 16kHz mono WAV (temp, auto-deleted)</li>
          <li>First pass with <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">base</code> model — fast full-audio run</li>
          <li>Score each segment: green / yellow / red</li>
          <li>Re-transcribe yellow segments with <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">turbo</code></li>
          <li>Re-transcribe red segments with <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">large-v3</code> (opt-in)</li>
          <li>Write <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">.txt</code> and <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">.json</code> with per-segment metadata</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Segment Scoring -->
      <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6">
        <h2 class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">4. Segment Scoring</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3">
          Each segment is classified green / yellow / red based on multiple heuristics.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
          <li><code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">avg_logprob</code> — model confidence</li>
          <li><code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">no_speech_prob</code> — silence / noise</li>
          <li><code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">compression_ratio</code> — repetition detection</li>
          <li>Repeated word detection</li>
          <li>Short / long segment anomalies</li>
          <li>Known hallucination phrase matching</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-3">JSON output includes per-segment: model used, difficulty class, confidence scores, reason flags.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. SQLite State Ledger -->
      <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6">
        <h2 class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">5. SQLite State Ledger</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3">
          Persistent DB at <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">podcasts/.podcast_transcriber_state.sqlite</code>. Tracks every episode through all processing steps.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>Feed + episode metadata (URL, title, slug, GUID, pub date)</li>
          <li>Config: model, language, pipeline mode</li>
          <li>Paths: audio, txt, srt, json, nfo</li>
          <li>Step statuses: download, transcription, metadata, nfo, overall</li>
          <li>SHA256 + size + mtime for all artifacts</li>
          <li>Error messages, retry counts, timing</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. Resumable Processing -->
      <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6">
        <h2 class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">6. Resumable Processing</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3">
          Every run is safe to interrupt. State is saved incrementally.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside">
          <li><span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Download skip:</span> audio exists + size + SHA256 match → skip</li>
          <li><span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Transcription skip:</span> transcript + hash + same model/language/audio → skip</li>
          <li><span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Crash recovery:</span> <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">running</code> state at startup → auto-reset to <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">partial</code></li>
          <li><span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Stale detection:</span> audio hash changes → transcript marked stale, re-transcribed next run</li>
          <li><span class="text-gray-300 font-medium">Batch safety:</span> one failure doesn't stop the batch</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 7. Integrity Verification -->
      <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6">
        <h2 class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">7. Integrity Verification</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3">
          SHA256 + file size + mtime tracking for all artifacts.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded p-4 font-mono text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-1">
          <div>podcast_sync.py <span class="text-indigo-400">--verify</span></div>
          <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs"># verify file existence + hashes</div>
          <div class="mt-2">podcast_sync.py <span class="text-indigo-400">--verify-hashes</span></div>
          <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs"># full SHA256 re-verification</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 8. Backfill Existing Podcasts -->
      <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6">
        <h2 class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">8. Backfill Existing Podcasts</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3">
          Import pre-existing transcripts into the state DB without re-processing.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded p-4 font-mono text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-1 mb-3">
          <div>python backfill_state.py</div>
          <div>python backfill_state.py <span class="text-indigo-400">--dry-run</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
          Infers model from folder prefix (<code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">base_</code>, <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">small_</code>, <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">large-v3_</code>, etc.) and computes SHA256 for all artifacts.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Output Formats -->
    <div class="mt-8 bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6">
      <h2 class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold text-xl mb-4">9. Output Formats</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="text-left border-b border-gray-700">
              <th class="pb-3 pr-6 text-gray-300 font-semibold">File</th>
              <th class="pb-3 text-gray-300 font-semibold">Contents</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-700">
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6"><code class="bg-gray-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">.txt</code></td>
              <td class="py-3 text-gray-400">Plain text transcript, one line per segment</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6"><code class="bg-gray-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">.srt</code></td>
              <td class="py-3 text-gray-400">SubRip subtitles with timestamps</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6"><code class="bg-gray-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">.json</code></td>
              <td class="py-3 text-gray-400">Segments with timestamps; includes confidence metadata when using the pipeline</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6"><code class="bg-gray-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">.nfo</code></td>
              <td class="py-3 text-gray-400">Hardware info, model used, word count, realtime ratio</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Models -->
    <div class="mt-8 bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6">
      <h2 class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold text-xl mb-2">10. Whisper Models</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">
        Models download automatically on first use and are cached in <code class="bg-gray-900 px-1 rounded text-xs">.models/</code>.
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="text-left border-b border-gray-700">
              <th class="pb-3 pr-6 text-gray-300 font-semibold">Model</th>
              <th class="pb-3 pr-6 text-gray-300 font-semibold">Size</th>
              <th class="pb-3 text-gray-300 font-semibold">Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-700">
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6"><code class="bg-gray-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">tiny</code></td>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-gray-400">75 MB</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-gray-400">Fast, lower quality</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6"><code class="bg-gray-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">base</code></td>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-gray-400">145 MB</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-gray-400">Default first pass</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6"><code class="bg-gray-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">small</code></td>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-gray-400">244 MB</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-gray-400">Better quality</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6"><code class="bg-gray-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">medium</code></td>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-gray-400">769 MB</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-gray-400">High quality</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6"><code class="bg-gray-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">turbo</code></td>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-gray-400">~809 MB</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-gray-400">Fast, good quality; used for yellow re-pass</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6"><code class="bg-gray-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">large-v3</code></td>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-gray-400">~1.5 GB</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-gray-400">Best quality; used for red re-pass (opt-in)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6"><code class="bg-gray-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">distil-large-v3</code></td>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-gray-400">~1.5 GB</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-gray-400">Distilled large-v3, fast</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
